      "id": "quantizer",
      "focus": "Explain the EXL3 quantization pipeline, Hessian/LDLQ error feedback, trellis search and procedural codebook, packing, transforms and numerical assumptions. Map named Python/CUDA functions to QTIP v3 and QuIP# v2 algorithms and the pinned QTIP reference functions. Distinguish exact mapping, adaptation and inference. Explain substantive design tradeoffs; do not merely list files. Explain the codebook-scale and outlier constants by deriving the procedural decoder statistics with standard-library Python through run, preserving the integer and floating-point semantics. Report what the computation does and does not verify. Cross-reference the quantized-inference chapter for the reason indices remain in tensor-core order.",
